<title>JAPAN: Toshiba - 6mth parent results. [CORRECTED 05:48 GMT]</title>
<headline>Toshiba - 6mth parent results. [CORRECTED 05:48 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.76 trln	 vs	    1.68 trln</p>
<p> Operating	   55.38		vs	   39.31</p>
<p> Current	     48.11		vs	   32.33</p>
<p> Net		   29.24		vs	   24.73</p>
<p> EPS		    9.09 yen	  vs	    7.68 yen</p>
<p>(Corrects EPS figure from 9.90 yen to 9.09 yen)</p>
<p> Shares	   3.22 billion	  vs	3.22 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Toshiba Corp is a leading electric machinery maker.</p>
